.max-w-2xl.space-y-6
  %p.text-sm.font-semibold.uppercase.tracking-widest.text-indigo-600 About
  %h1.text-4xl|5xl.font-bold.tracking-tight About {{App}}
  %p.text-lg.text-slate-600
    {{App}} is a simple Lux demo starter app: a public promo page, a workspace
    behind AuthCog sign-in, and an admin area. Nothing here is precious - delete
    it and build your own.
  %ul.space-y-2.text-slate-600
    %li URLs are declared in ./app/routes.rb; /app and /admin get their own controllers.
    %li This page has no action - promo is convention routed, so app/views/promo/about.haml is enough.
    %li PostgreSQL through Sequel, with the schema declared on the model.
    %li Access is decided on the server by UserPolicy, never in the view.
    %li PostWind classes and Fez components, bundled by the rollup watcher.
  %p.text-sm.text-slate-500
    This page arrived over pjax. The layout marks
    %code.rounded.bg-slate-100.px-1 &lt;main&gt;
    as the pjax container, so following a link swaps only that node and the
    browser never reloads the document.
